; 荘厳な鐘の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_33 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我听到深沉钟声一次次响起，<br>响彻整个监牢。|#0201Adv25_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这声音是……）|#0201Adv25_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:长时间的拘禁让我精疲力尽，<br>我缓慢抬起沉重的脑袋。|#0201Adv25_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:直觉告诉我，<br>这就是宣告魔女审判开庭的钟声。|#0201Adv25_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:看守很快出现在惩罚室里——|#0201Adv25_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在没有得到任何自由和信息的情况下，<br>我再次被带走。|#0201Adv25_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

; ゆっくりと大扉を開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_165 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:13_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.99 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_2_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_2_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我被押送到审判庭，<br>被安排站在类似证人席的地方，<br>然后终于给我解开了束缚。|#0201Adv25_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:环绕的证人席上，<br>已经有11名少女就位。|#0201Adv25_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这里就是，审判庭吗……）|#0201Adv25_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守正在出入口大门处站岗。|#0201Adv25_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于，站在扶手上的典狱长开始发言。<br>|#0201Adv25_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……首先我要说明一下<br>魔女审判的规则。|#0201Adv25_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:经过1小时的辩论之后，<br>我会请各位用你们的手机投票，选出你们心中认定的凶手。|#0201Adv25_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而在投票中被选为魔女的人物，<br>会被带到中间的底座处，执行处刑……大概就这样。|#0201Adv25_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,60 AppearanceAndTransition:13_1 SubId:Middle
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:25 Duration:20
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们看我的眼神<br>依旧充满怀疑和恐惧。|#0201Adv25_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（情况仍然对我极为不利）|#0201Adv25_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而我也<br>依旧心怀对她们的憎恨。|#0201Adv25_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我冷冷地扫视着<br>每一个少女。|#0201Adv25_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（在这些人中，藏着一个可恶的【魔女】）|#0201Adv25_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我一定要把她揪出来）|#0201Adv25_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（你会为陷害过我而后悔的……！！）|#0201Adv25_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，魔女审判现在开庭！|#0201Adv25_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

